                    "description": "Sends an outbound message on the selected channel. Use the `channel` field to select `sms`, `whatsapp`, or `rcs`. For SMS, `type` selects MKT (marketing), TXN (transactional), or OTP. Multiple recipients are comma-separated in `to`."
